✅ Step 4: Deploy & Test

1. Push both components to your org.


2. Add <c-data-table-with-dropdown></c-data-table-with-dropdown> to a Lightning App Page.


3. Ensure the records exist (Accounts with matching IDs).


4. Click the ➕ icon to expand — the child component will show real-time record data.




